  "duration_s": 627.333991,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您知道中国不可思议的长寿村都有哪些吗？上集，咱们聊了长青村、三山岛村、石鼓坪村、漫水村、水坪村。这集直接揭开谜底，看看前五名不可思议到什么程度，尤其是排在榜首的那座。既没有江南的水汽，既没有山林的青绿，竟然顶着干旱风沙生活在大沙漠落的跟前。话不多说，茶给您沏好了，劳烦您顺手点个小红心，咱们这就开讲。第五名，四川都江堰青秀村青城山路的川西临盘村子，背靠中年苍翠的青城山几百户农家散落在茂林修竹之间，八九十岁、耳聪目明的老人比比皆是。这里守着两千多年前李冰父子开凿的灌渠源头，水旱从人不知机锦，您要是挑个舞后。坐在青秀村的农家小院里，门前是奔流不息的雪山融水耳边是风吹楠木的沙沙声。八十多岁的老大爷正悠哉悠哉的抿着盖碗茶，摆起龙门阵来能讲上大半天。天府之国的从容与松弛，全被他们泡进了一杯清茶里。天下最舒坦的寿数，莫过于这份骨子里的从容。第四名，浙江永嘉林坑村南西江源头的浙南古村，村子藏在深山峡谷里，整村只有几百口人。八九十岁的高寿长者就有几十位村史里百岁寿星代代有名。林坑人七百年来耕读传家。这里的长寿带着一种罕见的书卷气，您踩的卵石台阶登上半山腰，木窗里透出暖黄的光。八九十岁的老先生不戴老花镜，稳稳当当，握着毛笔给乡邻写对联儿，或者翻看着泛黄的古籍。他们吃着山泉野菜，走着陡峭山路，身子骨清瘦，却极硬朗，把日子过成了山水诗。这不仅是长寿，更是一种沁透风骨的人文雅致。第三名，河南夏邑彭楼村黄河顾道府地的中原村落，在这片厚重的中原大地上，全村千余口人、八九十岁的高瘦长者随处可见，是名扬中原的孝善之乡。这里没有奇山异水，千百年来靠着一犁一耙在黄土地里讨生活。您走在彭楼村，宽敞的水泥路上，正午的太阳暖融融的洒在砖墙上，年轻媳妇端着热腾腾的手擀面送到老人床前，街坊四邻路过，都要停下来，嘘寒问暖。在这里，谁家要是对老人不敬，连脊梁骨都会被全村人戳破。中原大地的敦厚家风，硬是把孝悌二字化成了老人心头最踏实的定心丸。第二名，广西河池巴马县贾转镇平安村八盘屯闻名中外的巴马核心长寿村盘阳河绕村而过，全屯五百多口人百岁健在的老人比例高居全国前列。几十年来，来自全国各地的探访者踏破了门槛，人们把这里的山泉水、空气甚至土壤都捧成了神话。您漫步在巴盘屯依山傍水的沿河栈道上，满眼是喀斯特地貌的秀丽风丛。百岁老人盘腿坐在竹席上，神态宁静的看着熙熙攘攘的游客。在几乎所有人的心里，巴马就是中国长寿村无可争议的天花板。可如果连名满天下的巴马都只能排在第二，那力压他的第一名到底长什么样？先别急，聊到这儿，我先唠几句心里话。前面看完了九个村子，其实大家心里真正在琢磨的，恐怕不是那些地方风景有多好，而是他们怎么能过得这么硬朗。看着视频里，那些八九十岁的老太太挑着一担菜篮，还能稳稳迈过门槛儿。八十多岁的老汉站在海滩边，拉网手脚照样麻利。九十多岁的老阿婆坐在院儿里，剥着花生手指头，一点都不含糊。到了咱们这个年岁。心里其实比谁都清楚，这哪是普通的劳作，这是天大的福气，更是实打实的硬朗。可回过头来看看咱们自己走两步路，容易觉得发沉有点重东西，手腕使不上劲，拎时蹲下去系个鞋带，起身都得扶着膝盖缓上半天。这真不是咱们偷懒。这这半辈子来来哪一天不是在为工作操心，为儿女忙活，整天光顾着照顾全家老小，唯独忘了顾一顾自个儿等。好不容易能歇口气了，才发觉身子骨早已不如当年了，咱们不怕年岁见长净正怕的是往后日子里，腿脚不听使唤，样样都要人照应，净给孩子们添负担。前阵子我读到一本书叫超越百岁。作者，彼得阿提亚是一位长腿，其深耕健康科学领域的研究者。这本书不叫咱们怎么找好山好水，他就讲明白一件事，人上了岁数，到底怎样才能踏踏实实守住自己生活自理的尊严。作者在书里梳理出了一套非常实在的日常活动和起居方法。教咱们怎么把力气和底子一点点打扎实。前面九个村子的老人家，那是祖祖辈辈在田间地头自然而然过出来的硬朗，可咱们普通人没有那个环境到底该怎么做？这本书里讲的也不是什么深奥的大道理，而是一整套清清楚楚的日常生活指引。从平时怎么把筋骨力道活动到位，怎么吃的顺口到上了岁数，怎么把心宽下来，作者全给拆成了，在家里就能照着做的明白。步骤书里甚至列了一份晚年自理的对照清单，让咱们对照着自己往后想保持的状态，一步一步把平时的身体底子打扎实。这本书我在商品橱窗也备了一份，感兴趣的朋友点开我的头像，进入主页进去看看咱们住不进长寿村，但可以把那份硬朗活法装进自己的屋里。好说回正题，第一名新疆和田拉依苏村为什么是他？因为在所有人的认知里，长寿必须依山傍水，气候宜人。克拉伊苏村偏偏坐落在塔克拉玛干大沙漠南园昆仑山北路的风沙带上，放眼望去，四周全是连绵起伏的黄色沙丘，年降水量不足四十毫米，蒸发量却高达两千多毫米。可就在这片极度干旱的土地上，几十位年过九旬甚至百岁的老人，不仅思维清晰，还能下地劳作。昆仑山的冰川融水穿过茫茫沙海，滋养出这片绿洲。老人们世代在低矮的生土，屋前种植核桃，打理葡萄，您顶着大漠干燥的热浪，走进村落深处，几位蓄着白胡须的维吾尔族老汉正坐在老核桃树下，手里弹拨着热瓦捕琴，随性唱起欢快的大漠民谣，甚至兴致一来还能踩到鼓点转上几个圈。他们没有温润如春的气候，也没有名贵药材的滋补，靠着昆仑雪水和骨子里的乐观旷达，在生命禁区的边缘活出了最顽强的奇迹。他彻底击碎了长寿直属于江南水乡的偏见。凭这份不可思议的生命韧劲，他排在第一，实至名归。十座村庄讲完了长青村，在平原上安居三山，倒在海浪里，打捞硬骨。石鼓村在土楼中聚足而居，漫水村把苗歌传了百年石坪村守着千年银杏与家风青秀村泡着盖碗茶享清闲。林坑村把日子过成了山水诗。彭州村用孝涕暖透了中原，黄土巴马在秀丽山水间成就了传奇，可只有新疆拉依苏村把家安在了漫天黄沙的边缘，却用热瓦浦的琴声与昆仑雪水在干旱的大漠里，活出了生命的倔强。您说什么叫不可思议？最不可思议的，从来不是躲在风调雨顺的温室里，而是在任何艰难的泥土上都能笑对风霜、向阳而生。最后问您一句，这十个长寿村您去过几个最想去哪一个？评论区告诉我。刚才说的那本超越百岁，我搁商品橱窗了，点开我的头像，进入主页里就能找到想听更多华夏大地的风土传奇。点个关注，咱们下期接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00001",
      "start_ms": 310,
      "end_ms": 4410,
      "text": "您知道中国不可思议的长寿村都有哪些吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00002",
      "start_ms": 5030,
      "end_ms": 5610,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5630,
      "end_ms": 12250,
      "text": "咱们聊了长青村、三山岛村、石鼓坪村、漫水村、水坪村。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00004",
      "start_ms": 13030,
      "end_ms": 15130,
      "text": "这集直接揭开谜底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00005",
      "start_ms": 15550,
      "end_ms": 18950,
      "text": "看看前五名不可思议到什么程度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00006",
      "start_ms": 19330,
      "end_ms": 21530,
      "text": "尤其是排在榜首的那座。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00007",
      "start_ms": 22010,
      "end_ms": 23910,
      "text": "既没有江南的水汽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00008",
      "start_ms": 24250,
      "end_ms": 26010,
      "text": "既没有山林的青绿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00009",
      "start_ms": 26370,
      "end_ms": 30660,
      "text": "竟然顶着干旱风沙生活在大沙漠落的跟前。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00010",
      "start_ms": 31040,
      "end_ms": 31780,
      "text": "话不多说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00011",
      "start_ms": 32020,
      "end_ms": 33220,
      "text": "茶给您沏好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00012",
      "start_ms": 33500,
      "end_ms": 35320,
      "text": "劳烦您顺手点个小红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00013",
      "start_ms": 35600,
      "end_ms": 36640,
      "text": "咱们这就开讲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00014",
      "start_ms": 36960,
      "end_ms": 37580,
      "text": "第五名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00015",
      "start_ms": 37920,
      "end_ms": 43560,
      "text": "四川都江堰青秀村青城山路的川西临盘村子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00016",
      "start_ms": 43560,
      "end_ms": 49440,
      "text": "背靠中年苍翠的青城山几百户农家散落在茂林修竹之间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00017",
      "start_ms": 50200,
      "end_ms": 53440,
      "text": "八九十岁、耳聪目明的老人比比皆是。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00018",
      "start_ms": 53880,
      "end_ms": 58540,
      "text": "这里守着两千多年前李冰父子开凿的灌渠源头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00019",
      "start_ms": 59300,
      "end_ms": 62025,
      "text": "水旱从人不知机锦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00020",
      "start_ms": 62460,
      "end_ms": 63975,
      "text": "您要是挑个舞后。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00021",
      "start_ms": 64330,
      "end_ms": 66785,
      "text": "坐在青秀村的农家小院里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00022",
      "start_ms": 67280,
      "end_ms": 73075,
      "text": "门前是奔流不息的雪山融水耳边是风吹楠木的沙沙声。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00023",
      "start_ms": 73580,
      "end_ms": 77915,
      "text": "八十多岁的老大爷正悠哉悠哉的抿着盖碗茶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00024",
      "start_ms": 78360,
      "end_ms": 80985,
      "text": "摆起龙门阵来能讲上大半天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00025",
      "start_ms": 81620,
      "end_ms": 84285,
      "text": "天府之国的从容与松弛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00026",
      "start_ms": 84870,
      "end_ms": 87565,
      "text": "全被他们泡进了一杯清茶里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00027",
      "start_ms": 88270,
      "end_ms": 90365,
      "text": "天下最舒坦的寿数，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00028",
      "start_ms": 90760,
      "end_ms": 93055,
      "text": "莫过于这份骨子里的从容。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00029",
      "start_ms": 93360,
      "end_ms": 94055,
      "text": "第四名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00030",
      "start_ms": 94520,
      "end_ms": 99265,
      "text": "浙江永嘉林坑村南西江源头的浙南古村，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00031",
      "start_ms": 99970,
      "end_ms": 102265,
      "text": "村子藏在深山峡谷里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00032",
      "start_ms": 102850,
      "end_ms": 104555,
      "text": "整村只有几百口人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00033",
      "start_ms": 105090,
      "end_ms": 110855,
      "text": "八九十岁的高寿长者就有几十位村史里百岁寿星代代有名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00034",
      "start_ms": 111280,
      "end_ms": 113725,
      "text": "林坑人七百年来耕读传家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00035",
      "start_ms": 114150,
      "end_ms": 117665,
      "text": "这里的长寿带着一种罕见的书卷气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00036",
      "start_ms": 118120,
      "end_ms": 120825,
      "text": "您踩的卵石台阶登上半山腰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00037",
      "start_ms": 121310,
      "end_ms": 123295,
      "text": "木窗里透出暖黄的光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00038",
      "start_ms": 124080,
      "end_ms": 126555,
      "text": "八九十岁的老先生不戴老花镜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00039",
      "start_ms": 127020,
      "end_ms": 127860,
      "text": "稳稳当当，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00040",
      "start_ms": 127860,
      "end_ms": 130095,
      "text": "握着毛笔给乡邻写对联儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00041",
      "start_ms": 130360,
      "end_ms": 132395,
      "text": "或者翻看着泛黄的古籍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00042",
      "start_ms": 132840,
      "end_ms": 134565,
      "text": "他们吃着山泉野菜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00043",
      "start_ms": 135020,
      "end_ms": 136295,
      "text": "走着陡峭山路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00044",
      "start_ms": 136850,
      "end_ms": 138030,
      "text": "身子骨清瘦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00045",
      "start_ms": 138230,
      "end_ms": 139095,
      "text": "却极硬朗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00046",
      "start_ms": 139820,
      "end_ms": 141545,
      "text": "把日子过成了山水诗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00047",
      "start_ms": 142140,
      "end_ms": 143385,
      "text": "这不仅是长寿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00048",
      "start_ms": 143860,
      "end_ms": 146505,
      "text": "更是一种沁透风骨的人文雅致。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00049",
      "start_ms": 146930,
      "end_ms": 147595,
      "text": "第三名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00050",
      "start_ms": 148110,
      "end_ms": 153385,
      "text": "河南夏邑彭楼村黄河顾道府地的中原村落，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00051",
      "start_ms": 154010,
      "end_ms": 156545,
      "text": "在这片厚重的中原大地上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00052",
      "start_ms": 157030,
      "end_ms": 162085,
      "text": "全村千余口人、八九十岁的高瘦长者随处可见，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00053",
      "start_ms": 162630,
      "end_ms": 165035,
      "text": "是名扬中原的孝善之乡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00054",
      "start_ms": 165450,
      "end_ms": 167095,
      "text": "这里没有奇山异水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00055",
      "start_ms": 167520,
      "end_ms": 171815,
      "text": "千百年来靠着一犁一耙在黄土地里讨生活。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00056",
      "start_ms": 172300,
      "end_ms": 173400,
      "text": "您走在彭楼村，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00057",
      "start_ms": 173400,
      "end_ms": 174685,
      "text": "宽敞的水泥路上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00058",
      "start_ms": 175560,
      "end_ms": 178355,
      "text": "正午的太阳暖融融的洒在砖墙上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00059",
      "start_ms": 179070,
      "end_ms": 183015,
      "text": "年轻媳妇端着热腾腾的手擀面送到老人床前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00060",
      "start_ms": 183660,
      "end_ms": 184920,
      "text": "街坊四邻路过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00061",
      "start_ms": 185040,
      "end_ms": 186040,
      "text": "都要停下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00062",
      "start_ms": 186100,
      "end_ms": 186855,
      "text": "嘘寒问暖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00063",
      "start_ms": 187300,
      "end_ms": 187855,
      "text": "在这里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00064",
      "start_ms": 188220,
      "end_ms": 190275,
      "text": "谁家要是对老人不敬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00065",
      "start_ms": 190680,
      "end_ms": 193795,
      "text": "连脊梁骨都会被全村人戳破。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00066",
      "start_ms": 194470,
      "end_ms": 196915,
      "text": "中原大地的敦厚家风，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00067",
      "start_ms": 197350,
      "end_ms": 202695,
      "text": "硬是把孝悌二字化成了老人心头最踏实的定心丸。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00068",
      "start_ms": 203050,
      "end_ms": 203715,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00069",
      "start_ms": 204240,
      "end_ms": 214275,
      "text": "广西河池巴马县贾转镇平安村八盘屯闻名中外的巴马核心长寿村盘阳河绕村而过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00070",
      "start_ms": 214700,
      "end_ms": 220615,
      "text": "全屯五百多口人百岁健在的老人比例高居全国前列。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00071",
      "start_ms": 221030,
      "end_ms": 221955,
      "text": "几十年来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00072",
      "start_ms": 222460,
      "end_ms": 225465,
      "text": "来自全国各地的探访者踏破了门槛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00073",
      "start_ms": 226080,
      "end_ms": 232545,
      "text": "人们把这里的山泉水、空气甚至土壤都捧成了神话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00074",
      "start_ms": 232980,
      "end_ms": 237015,
      "text": "您漫步在巴盘屯依山傍水的沿河栈道上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00075",
      "start_ms": 237490,
      "end_ms": 240565,
      "text": "满眼是喀斯特地貌的秀丽风丛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00076",
      "start_ms": 241130,
      "end_ms": 243615,
      "text": "百岁老人盘腿坐在竹席上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00077",
      "start_ms": 244050,
      "end_ms": 247275,
      "text": "神态宁静的看着熙熙攘攘的游客。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00078",
      "start_ms": 247750,
      "end_ms": 249885,
      "text": "在几乎所有人的心里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00079",
      "start_ms": 250220,
      "end_ms": 253565,
      "text": "巴马就是中国长寿村无可争议的天花板。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00080",
      "start_ms": 254350,
      "end_ms": 257725,
      "text": "可如果连名满天下的巴马都只能排在第二，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00081",
      "start_ms": 258210,
      "end_ms": 260875,
      "text": "那力压他的第一名到底长什么样？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00082",
      "start_ms": 261240,
      "end_ms": 261885,
      "text": "先别急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00083",
      "start_ms": 262420,
      "end_ms": 263115,
      "text": "聊到这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00084",
      "start_ms": 263500,
      "end_ms": 264925,
      "text": "我先唠几句心里话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00085",
      "start_ms": 265710,
      "end_ms": 267495,
      "text": "前面看完了九个村子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00086",
      "start_ms": 268020,
      "end_ms": 270285,
      "text": "其实大家心里真正在琢磨的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00087",
      "start_ms": 270920,
      "end_ms": 273825,
      "text": "恐怕不是那些地方风景有多好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00088",
      "start_ms": 274470,
      "end_ms": 277005,
      "text": "而是他们怎么能过得这么硬朗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00089",
      "start_ms": 277450,
      "end_ms": 278490,
      "text": "看着视频里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00090",
      "start_ms": 278490,
      "end_ms": 282735,
      "text": "那些八九十岁的老太太挑着一担菜篮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00091",
      "start_ms": 283190,
      "end_ms": 285165,
      "text": "还能稳稳迈过门槛儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00092",
      "start_ms": 285840,
      "end_ms": 288680,
      "text": "八十多岁的老汉站在海滩边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00093",
      "start_ms": 288700,
      "end_ms": 290975,
      "text": "拉网手脚照样麻利。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00094",
      "start_ms": 291600,
      "end_ms": 294735,
      "text": "九十多岁的老阿婆坐在院儿里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00095",
      "start_ms": 294990,
      "end_ms": 296835,
      "text": "剥着花生手指头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00096",
      "start_ms": 297140,
      "end_ms": 298045,
      "text": "一点都不含糊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00097",
      "start_ms": 298730,
      "end_ms": 300095,
      "text": "到了咱们这个年岁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00098",
      "start_ms": 300530,
      "end_ms": 302450,
      "text": "心里其实比谁都清楚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00099",
      "start_ms": 302970,
      "end_ms": 304650,
      "text": "这哪是普通的劳作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00100",
      "start_ms": 305110,
      "end_ms": 306750,
      "text": "这是天大的福气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00101",
      "start_ms": 307310,
      "end_ms": 309030,
      "text": "更是实打实的硬朗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00102",
      "start_ms": 309630,
      "end_ms": 312890,
      "text": "可回过头来看看咱们自己走两步路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00103",
      "start_ms": 312890,
      "end_ms": 315810,
      "text": "容易觉得发沉有点重东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00104",
      "start_ms": 315970,
      "end_ms": 316990,
      "text": "手腕使不上劲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00105",
      "start_ms": 317630,
      "end_ms": 319330,
      "text": "拎时蹲下去系个鞋带，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00106",
      "start_ms": 319710,
      "end_ms": 321830,
      "text": "起身都得扶着膝盖缓上半天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00107",
      "start_ms": 321830,
      "end_ms": 323790,
      "text": "这真不是咱们偷懒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00108",
      "start_ms": 323790,
      "end_ms": 328350,
      "text": "这这半辈子来来哪一天不是在为工作操心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00109",
      "start_ms": 328710,
      "end_ms": 329790,
      "text": "为儿女忙活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00110",
      "start_ms": 330440,
      "end_ms": 333160,
      "text": "整天光顾着照顾全家老小，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00111",
      "start_ms": 333620,
      "end_ms": 335940,
      "text": "唯独忘了顾一顾自个儿等。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00112",
      "start_ms": 335960,
      "end_ms": 338060,
      "text": "好不容易能歇口气了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00113",
      "start_ms": 338400,
      "end_ms": 341300,
      "text": "才发觉身子骨早已不如当年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00114",
      "start_ms": 341580,
      "end_ms": 346980,
      "text": "咱们不怕年岁见长净正怕的是往后日子里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00115",
      "start_ms": 347020,
      "end_ms": 348480,
      "text": "腿脚不听使唤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00116",
      "start_ms": 348980,
      "end_ms": 350760,
      "text": "样样都要人照应，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00117",
      "start_ms": 351180,
      "end_ms": 353020,
      "text": "净给孩子们添负担。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00118",
      "start_ms": 353740,
      "end_ms": 357220,
      "text": "前阵子我读到一本书叫超越百岁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00119",
      "start_ms": 357580,
      "end_ms": 358060,
      "text": "作者，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00120",
      "start_ms": 358160,
      "end_ms": 360310,
      "text": "彼得阿提亚是一位长腿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00121",
      "start_ms": 360430,
      "end_ms": 363555,
      "text": "其深耕健康科学领域的研究者。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00122",
      "start_ms": 363970,
      "end_ms": 366835,
      "text": "这本书不叫咱们怎么找好山好水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00123",
      "start_ms": 367340,
      "end_ms": 369135,
      "text": "他就讲明白一件事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00124",
      "start_ms": 369700,
      "end_ms": 371125,
      "text": "人上了岁数，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00125",
      "start_ms": 371860,
      "end_ms": 376715,
      "text": "到底怎样才能踏踏实实守住自己生活自理的尊严。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00126",
      "start_ms": 377170,
      "end_ms": 382465,
      "text": "作者在书里梳理出了一套非常实在的日常活动和起居方法。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00127",
      "start_ms": 383060,
      "end_ms": 387875,
      "text": "教咱们怎么把力气和底子一点点打扎实。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00128",
      "start_ms": 388300,
      "end_ms": 390635,
      "text": "前面九个村子的老人家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00129",
      "start_ms": 390960,
      "end_ms": 395375,
      "text": "那是祖祖辈辈在田间地头自然而然过出来的硬朗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00130",
      "start_ms": 395980,
      "end_ms": 399605,
      "text": "可咱们普通人没有那个环境到底该怎么做？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00131",
      "start_ms": 400100,
      "end_ms": 403515,
      "text": "这本书里讲的也不是什么深奥的大道理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00132",
      "start_ms": 403910,
      "end_ms": 408095,
      "text": "而是一整套清清楚楚的日常生活指引。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00133",
      "start_ms": 408960,
      "end_ms": 411865,
      "text": "从平时怎么把筋骨力道活动到位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00134",
      "start_ms": 412360,
      "end_ms": 415110,
      "text": "怎么吃的顺口到上了岁数，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00135",
      "start_ms": 415150,
      "end_ms": 416775,
      "text": "怎么把心宽下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00136",
      "start_ms": 417240,
      "end_ms": 418700,
      "text": "作者全给拆成了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00137",
      "start_ms": 418700,
      "end_ms": 421180,
      "text": "在家里就能照着做的明白。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00138",
      "start_ms": 421220,
      "end_ms": 425755,
      "text": "步骤书里甚至列了一份晚年自理的对照清单，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00139",
      "start_ms": 426450,
      "end_ms": 430075,
      "text": "让咱们对照着自己往后想保持的状态，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00140",
      "start_ms": 430570,
      "end_ms": 433745,
      "text": "一步一步把平时的身体底子打扎实。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00141",
      "start_ms": 434150,
      "end_ms": 436715,
      "text": "这本书我在商品橱窗也备了一份，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00142",
      "start_ms": 437190,
      "end_ms": 439890,
      "text": "感兴趣的朋友点开我的头像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00143",
      "start_ms": 440050,
      "end_ms": 444235,
      "text": "进入主页进去看看咱们住不进长寿村，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00144",
      "start_ms": 444660,
      "end_ms": 448305,
      "text": "但可以把那份硬朗活法装进自己的屋里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00145",
      "start_ms": 448700,
      "end_ms": 450235,
      "text": "好说回正题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00146",
      "start_ms": 450700,
      "end_ms": 455365,
      "text": "第一名新疆和田拉依苏村为什么是他？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00147",
      "start_ms": 456050,
      "end_ms": 458115,
      "text": "因为在所有人的认知里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00148",
      "start_ms": 458450,
      "end_ms": 460845,
      "text": "长寿必须依山傍水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00149",
      "start_ms": 461170,
      "end_ms": 461945,
      "text": "气候宜人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00150",
      "start_ms": 462380,
      "end_ms": 469255,
      "text": "克拉伊苏村偏偏坐落在塔克拉玛干大沙漠南园昆仑山北路的风沙带上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00151",
      "start_ms": 469660,
      "end_ms": 470605,
      "text": "放眼望去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00152",
      "start_ms": 471030,
      "end_ms": 474175,
      "text": "四周全是连绵起伏的黄色沙丘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00153",
      "start_ms": 474890,
      "end_ms": 477035,
      "text": "年降水量不足四十毫米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00154",
      "start_ms": 477480,
      "end_ms": 480235,
      "text": "蒸发量却高达两千多毫米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00155",
      "start_ms": 480660,
      "end_ms": 483405,
      "text": "可就在这片极度干旱的土地上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00156",
      "start_ms": 484050,
      "end_ms": 487610,
      "text": "几十位年过九旬甚至百岁的老人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00157",
      "start_ms": 487670,
      "end_ms": 488875,
      "text": "不仅思维清晰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00158",
      "start_ms": 489170,
      "end_ms": 490195,
      "text": "还能下地劳作。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00159",
      "start_ms": 490640,
      "end_ms": 494100,
      "text": "昆仑山的冰川融水穿过茫茫沙海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00160",
      "start_ms": 494180,
      "end_ms": 495665,
      "text": "滋养出这片绿洲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00161",
      "start_ms": 496260,
      "end_ms": 498660,
      "text": "老人们世代在低矮的生土，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00162",
      "start_ms": 498660,
      "end_ms": 500205,
      "text": "屋前种植核桃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00163",
      "start_ms": 500630,
      "end_ms": 501625,
      "text": "打理葡萄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00164",
      "start_ms": 502020,
      "end_ms": 503740,
      "text": "您顶着大漠干燥的热浪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00165",
      "start_ms": 503740,
      "end_ms": 505105,
      "text": "走进村落深处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00166",
      "start_ms": 505580,
      "end_ms": 510045,
      "text": "几位蓄着白胡须的维吾尔族老汉正坐在老核桃树下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00167",
      "start_ms": 510510,
      "end_ms": 512865,
      "text": "手里弹拨着热瓦捕琴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00168",
      "start_ms": 513630,
      "end_ms": 516215,
      "text": "随性唱起欢快的大漠民谣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00169",
      "start_ms": 516730,
      "end_ms": 519935,
      "text": "甚至兴致一来还能踩到鼓点转上几个圈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00170",
      "start_ms": 520470,
      "end_ms": 522795,
      "text": "他们没有温润如春的气候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00171",
      "start_ms": 523140,
      "end_ms": 525245,
      "text": "也没有名贵药材的滋补，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00172",
      "start_ms": 525910,
      "end_ms": 529690,
      "text": "靠着昆仑雪水和骨子里的乐观旷达，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00173",
      "start_ms": 530090,
      "end_ms": 534535,
      "text": "在生命禁区的边缘活出了最顽强的奇迹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00174",
      "start_ms": 534990,
      "end_ms": 539865,
      "text": "他彻底击碎了长寿直属于江南水乡的偏见。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00175",
      "start_ms": 540450,
      "end_ms": 543350,
      "text": "凭这份不可思议的生命韧劲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00176",
      "start_ms": 543570,
      "end_ms": 544610,
      "text": "他排在第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00177",
      "start_ms": 544990,
      "end_ms": 545750,
      "text": "实至名归。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00178",
      "start_ms": 546110,
      "end_ms": 548850,
      "text": "十座村庄讲完了长青村，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00179",
      "start_ms": 548910,
      "end_ms": 551430,
      "text": "在平原上安居三山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00180",
      "start_ms": 551490,
      "end_ms": 552490,
      "text": "倒在海浪里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00181",
      "start_ms": 552490,
      "end_ms": 553290,
      "text": "打捞硬骨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00182",
      "start_ms": 553750,
      "end_ms": 556269,
      "text": "石鼓村在土楼中聚足而居，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00183",
      "start_ms": 556790,
      "end_ms": 565610,
      "text": "漫水村把苗歌传了百年石坪村守着千年银杏与家风青秀村泡着盖碗茶享清闲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00184",
      "start_ms": 566270,
      "end_ms": 568990,
      "text": "林坑村把日子过成了山水诗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00185",
      "start_ms": 568990,
      "end_ms": 572760,
      "text": "彭州村用孝涕暖透了中原，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00186",
      "start_ms": 572800,
      "end_ms": 576960,
      "text": "黄土巴马在秀丽山水间成就了传奇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00187",
      "start_ms": 577400,
      "end_ms": 581920,
      "text": "可只有新疆拉依苏村把家安在了漫天黄沙的边缘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00188",
      "start_ms": 582740,
      "end_ms": 587420,
      "text": "却用热瓦浦的琴声与昆仑雪水在干旱的大漠里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00189",
      "start_ms": 587540,
      "end_ms": 589100,
      "text": "活出了生命的倔强。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00190",
      "start_ms": 589520,
      "end_ms": 590960,
      "text": "您说什么叫不可思议？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00191",
      "start_ms": 591380,
      "end_ms": 592800,
      "text": "最不可思议的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00192",
      "start_ms": 593280,
      "end_ms": 596460,
      "text": "从来不是躲在风调雨顺的温室里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00193",
      "start_ms": 596820,
      "end_ms": 602590,
      "text": "而是在任何艰难的泥土上都能笑对风霜、向阳而生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00194",
      "start_ms": 603350,
      "end_ms": 604630,
      "text": "最后问您一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00195",
      "start_ms": 605290,
      "end_ms": 610130,
      "text": "这十个长寿村您去过几个最想去哪一个？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00196",
      "start_ms": 610830,
      "end_ms": 612230,
      "text": "评论区告诉我。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00197",
      "start_ms": 612870,
      "end_ms": 615050,
      "text": "刚才说的那本超越百岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00198",
      "start_ms": 615630,
      "end_ms": 617190,
      "text": "我搁商品橱窗了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00199",
      "start_ms": 617610,
      "end_ms": 618930,
      "text": "点开我的头像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00200",
      "start_ms": 619170,
      "end_ms": 624070,
      "text": "进入主页里就能找到想听更多华夏大地的风土传奇。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00201",
      "start_ms": 624410,
      "end_ms": 625210,
      "text": "点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d00cee56eff9e90d_s00202",
      "start_ms": 625470,
      "end_ms": 627065,
      "text": "咱们下期接着聊。"
    }
  ],
